@startuml Launch a Prediction - Black Box Sequence Diagram

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #D5E8D4
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A90D9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #1A1A2E
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #4A90D9

actor "User" as User

box "System" #1A1A2E
    participant "Stock Market\nPrediction Dashboard" as System #2C3E50
end box

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 1 — SELECT MODEL
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
User -> System : Select prediction model\n(ARIMA / ARMA / SARIMA)
System --> User : Model selection confirmed\nParameter form displayed

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 2 — CONFIGURE PARAMETERS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
User -> System : Configure parameters\n(Auto or Custom: p, d, q, steps)
System --> User : Configuration ready

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 3 — RUN PREDICTION
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
User -> System : Click "Run Prediction"

activate System
note right of System
    System internally:
    • Fetches stock price data
    • Trains the selected model
    • Generates forecast
    • Computes metrics
end note

System --> User : Prediction chart displayed\n(historical + forecast overlay)
System --> User : Metrics displayed\n(RMSE, MAE, MAPE, AIC, BIC)
System --> User : Optimal parameters shown\n(if Auto mode was used)
deactivate System

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 4 — SAVE EXPERIMENT (authenticated)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
alt User is logged in
    User -> System : Click "Save"
    System --> User : "Prediction saved successfully" ✓

else User is not logged in
    User -> System : Click "Save"
    System --> User : Redirect to Login page
    User -> System : Submit credentials
    System --> User : Redirected back to prediction screen
    System --> User : "Prediction saved successfully" ✓
end

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 5 — ERROR CASE
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
group #FFEBEE "Alt — Prediction Fails"
    User -> System : Click "Run Prediction"
    activate System
    System --> User : Error message displayed
    deactivate System
end

@enduml
